# Auto-sourced by setup.md step 1 before spawning agents.
# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in real values — never commit .env.
#
# Long-lived subscription token from `claude setup-token`, passed into every agent container you
# run yourself with a bare -e NAME (see setup.md step 4). Takes priority over any mounted ~/.claude credentials
# file automatically (SDK precedence), so agents authenticate against the subscription without
# needing the live host credentials mounted in.
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=

# The org API key every `hl` call of a run carries: `hl api-key create coordinator`, run once by a
# member of the org. A staff token is for operating the platform itself.
HL_TOKEN=
